# Citation File Format v1.2.0 — https://citation-file-format.github.io/
# Validate with: cffconvert --validate
cff-version: 1.2.0
title: aero-research-platform
message: |
  If you use this software in academic work, please cite the Zenodo deposit
  (concept DOI below). To cite a specific result, give its result-crate
  digest (the sha256 of the crate's SHA256SUMS; see crates/README.md) and its
  four-tuple (git_sha, dvc_input_hash, container_sif_sha256, config_hash).
  The digest and the four-tuple are what make a citation point to a specific
  result, not just to the platform.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Louis Ernesto
    family-names: Schulte Moredo
    email: gr7x8mjy5d@privaterelay.appleid.com
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0004-8145-8319
    affiliation: Independent Researcher
repository-code: https://github.com/ernesto01louis/aero-research-platform
url: https://github.com/ernesto01louis/aero-research-platform
abstract: |
  An open-source, CFD-in-the-loop aerodynamic shape optimizer whose outputs
  are gated by provenance and uncertainty. Every reported number carries a
  four-fold provenance tuple (git SHA, DVC input-sync hash, Apptainer SIF
  SHA-256, config hash) and a combined U95 envelope. U95 combines a GCI /
  ASME V&V 20 numerical term, a batch-means statistical term and an input
  term. A claimed improvement must exceed 2 x U95 at matched numerics, every
  optimum is re-verified by CFD, and every exported result is a
  self-describing result crate (RO-Crate 1.3 / PROV) that verifies away from
  the compute cluster. The forward stack runs OpenFOAM-ESI and preCICE in
  Apptainer containers. Version 0.1.0 demonstrates the optimizer on a 2-D
  airfoil (validated tier, gate-honest) and the forward capability on a rigid
  flapping wing, whose gated mean lift is a documented NO-GO. The optimizer
  has never been run on a flapping-wing case, and v0.1.0 makes no
  flapping-wing optimization claim.
keywords:
  - computational fluid dynamics
  - aerodynamics
  - aerodynamic shape optimization
  - Bayesian optimization
  - flapping-wing aerodynamics
  - OpenFOAM
  - preCICE
  - fluid-structure interaction
  - verification and validation
  - uncertainty quantification
  - provenance
  - reproducibility
  - RO-Crate
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-15"
# Zenodo concept DOI — resolves to the latest Zenodo version (v0.1.0 once its GitHub Release is
# published). Per-version DOIs are minted per GitHub Release; see docs/release/zenodo.md.
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.20292712

